                "claim": "Rewrite now appends instructions even for empty SubagentType. Instructions are only workflow-derived and sanitized, so no exploit path is shown. The change is behavior the ADR requested. The idempotence check uses a substring match, so a prompt that quotes the block would skip it. That only affects delivery of instructions and carries no security impact.",
