              }
            ],
            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all 13 changed paths in the patch.",
              "Instruction values from the workflow (goal, project, identity, sources) pass through sanitizeLine and strconv.Quote and are bounded by boundContext. The test at engine/projection/instructions_test.go covers a goal containing a newline and an escape sequence, so prompt injection through a newline is not reachable.",
              "The new OnInstructions path is read-only and never unbinds. The cwd added to DecodeAgentCall is cleaned and must be absolute; non-text values are ignored, so no new decode failure is introduced.",
              "No secrets, new dependencies, or authorization changes are introduced. The block adds no enforcement and only describes the existing M4 and M5 rules."
